docs/
roadmaps/
*.md
!plugins/jarvis/mcp-server/defaults/**/*.md

# Build/packaging artifacts (not needed in runtime image)
dist/
build/
**/pyproject.toml
!lib/jarvis-common/pyproject.toml
**/uv.lock
**/requirements.txt

# Dev files
tmp-*
peon.sh
